<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Nedcor enters alliance with Schroders.</title>
<headline>Nedcor enters alliance with Schroders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nedcor Bank Ltd said on Wednesday it had chosen UK fund managers Schroder Investment Management as its partner in offering offshore unit trusts.</p>
<p>The bank said Schroders, which manages over $150 billion worth of funds worldwide, would manage its range of off-shore funds.</p>
<p>&quot;Schroders was Nedcor Bank's first choice as a partner to manage our off-shore unit trusts,&quot; Nedcor chief executive Richard Laubscher said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
